# Phase 50: Syntax & Hook Normalization (Build #601)

This phase aims to restore the "Zero-Defect Baseline" by cleaning up unused imports and fixing critical React Hook violations that cause build failures.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This refactor fixes a critical React Hook violation in [CausalInferenceViewer.jsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/components/anomalies/CausalInferenceViewer.jsx) where `useMemo` was called after a conditional return. This is a breaking error in production builds.

## Proposed Changes

### [Frontend Components]

#### [MODIFY] [Pricing.jsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/pages/Pricing.jsx)
- Remove unused `base44` import.

#### [MODIFY] [AIAssistant.jsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/pages/AIAssistant.jsx)
- Remove unused [QuantumEngine](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/universal_quantum_dist/index.js#281-603) import.

#### [MODIFY] [QuantumDashboard.jsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/components/anomalies/QuantumDashboard.jsx)
- Remove unused `AlertCircle` import.

#### [MODIFY] [QuantumAIInsightsPanel.jsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/components/admin/QuantumAIInsightsPanel.jsx)
- Remove unused `AlertTriangle` import.

#### [MODIFY] [CausalInferenceViewer.jsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/components/anomalies/CausalInferenceViewer.jsx)
- Move `strongRelationships` and `validatedRelationships` `useMemo` hooks to the top of the component (before the early return).

---

### [Build & Verification]

- Run `npm run build` locally within the project root.
- Ensure 0 errors and 0 warnings.

